  "description": "At its heart the Yarak burns with reverence for tradition, an immutable tribute to the pure power of the classic track bike.\nIn form it is a modern masterpiece, hewn from space age titanium, with semi-compact geometry and state of the art features like belt drive compatibility and a 44mm head tube for the unparalleled control and crisp, responsive handling of tapered fork steerers.\nThe colossal 42mm diameter downtube and 1-inch tapered chainstays are unique to this bike and pack a formidable punch, delivering fluid and efficient power transfer in a sprint while giving a silky smooth ride quality that minimizes rider fatigue, be it 16 laps or 6 days in the saddle.\nThe best of both old and new, our world class track bike serves as the ultimate weapon to own every centimeter of the boards, from the blue band to the balustrade.\nDesigned for the velodrome, unstoppable in the street.\nBelt Drive Compatible\nGates Carbon Drive™ compatible\nSeatpost collar\nBright brushed finish with black decal set\nHeadbadge\nBright brushed finish\nBLACK Classic decal set\nBLACK headset + bottom bracket",
